<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges down to 1.8365 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges down to 1.8365 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8365 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8360 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    February 28	   February 27</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8365		  1.8360</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $21.92 million	    $4.01 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
